OL,3,GNEWSAOver 1,000 dockless bikes seized
OL,4,Ain Westminster
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 1,000 dockless bikes have
OL,7,Fbeen seized from Westminster's streets
OL,8,Fsince May as part of a council
OL,9,Fcrackdown on obstructive parking.
OL,11,FWestminster City Council said it had
OL,12,Falso issued more than 5,300 fixed
OL,13,Fpenalty notices to bike operators
OL,14,Fduring the same period, amounting to
OL,15,Fmore than #53,000.
OL,17,FCaroline Sargent, the council's deputy
OL,18,Fleader and cabinet member for
OL,19,Fenforcement, said: "We promised we
OL,20,Fwould take action against badly parked
OL,21,Fdockless bikes and we meant it."
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
