OL,3,GNEWSAOver 1,000 dockless bikes seized
OL,4,Ain Westminster
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe figures were announced on the same
OL,7,Fday dockless bike operators and
OL,8,Ftransport officials discussed how the
OL,9,Fschemes should be regulated across
OL,10,FLondon at a London Assembly meeting.
